chapter.v:
And I 


will stir, 


up Egyptians against Egyptians, and they will fight, each against another and each against his neighbor, city against city, kingdom against kingdom;

and the 


spirit of, 


the Egyptians within them will be emptied out, and I will confound(1) their counsel; and they will inquire of the idols and the sorcerers, and the mediums and the necromancers;
